Receipt acceptance regressions passed: consecutive acknowledged submissions, earlier actionable receipts, both ACK/feed orders, overview/Prayer filter-return cleanup, stale callbacks and measured message-only scrolling with fixed controls; large-text native geometry remains unverified.
Community denial hotfix passed: exact uncoded SDK and coded denials, editable retained drafts, conservative near-match/transport handling, sticky uncertainty, frozen retries, acknowledged receipts and no duplicate contributions.
Actual check-in modal passed: audience order/labels, optional words, deferred private/shared receipts, double-submit/failure/retry/stale-session guards, both entry points, shared-only completed landing and repeat encouragement.
Saved check-ins passed: completed Home audience/link, delete/reset, private edit lock and shared reverse-transition lock.
Check-in privacy passed: Home and Community initial/reset/private/group submission handlers.
Prayer hierarchy passed: focused request actions, target/cancel/skip/complete/repeat contracts, personal prayer, request composer, filters/states/pagination, overview opt-in, and EN/SV counts/empty/action copy.
Community navigation passed: translated balanced Prayer requests/Check-ins cards, personal prayer within Prayer, Recent/Reflections and Share, stale filter fallback, iOS/Android filter/scroll and Back, dedicated page/content/empty/loading/error/offline rendering.
Feed card density passed: overview opt-in, one author avatar and primary action, secondary prayer, nonzero response counts, mood and Scripture, and explicit history reveal.
Managed Community composer passed: EN/SV pending and unknown feedback, locked draft/close/picker controls, explicit retry-only uncertainty and preserved failure drafts.
Community parent submission passed: synchronous duplicate guard, failure/success drafts, timeout uncertainty, stable retry, stale callbacks, scoped draft recovery and unchanged private Scripture reflection.
Community Share clarity passed: EN/SV four-type labels and contextual copy, named audience above fields, Scripture-first layout without picker remount, retained drafts, correct defaults, hidden-title payload exclusion and preserved journal/Bible behavior.
Community S3 mocked contracts passed: native keyboard inset/scroll props, multiline newline-only input, localized persistent labels and radio selection, narrow/large-text wrapping, deduplicated iOS status/validation announcements, Android live regions and Community-only picker keyboard dismissal; native iPhone geometry and VoiceOver remain unverified.
